{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50270","headline":"西林寺与樵（焦）链师赋得阶下泉 · 李翔","name":"西林寺与樵（焦）链师赋得阶下泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回廊折漩（旋）绕空阶，暗西宁舟霜泻峭崖。\n蕙带客寻经远涧，麻衣僧引到高斋。\n流分晓月光难驻，响入清琴韵易谐。\n时有真官访衰病，每同观听荡幽怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}